{"seq":4,"slug":"autonomous-perception","title":"自动驾驶感知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/autonomous-perception","wordCount":1223,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动驾驶感知\">自动驾驶感知</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自动驾驶感知系统是自动驾驶汽车的&quot;眼睛&quot;，负责感知车辆周围环境中的道路、车辆、行人、交通标志等关键要素。感知系统需要在极端天气、复杂光照和高速运动等条件下保持稳定可靠，其输出直接影响下游的预测和规划模块，对行车安全至关重要。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[传感器输入] --&gt; B{感知任务}&#10;    B --&gt; C[3D 目标检测]&#10;    B --&gt; D[语义分割]&#10;    B --&gt; E[车道线检测]&#10;    B --&gt; F[可行驶区域]&#10;    C --&gt; G[BEV 融合表示]&#10;    D --&gt; G&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[预测与规划]\">graph LR\n    A[传感器输入] --&gt; B{感知任务}\n    B --&gt; C[3D 目标检测]\n    B --&gt; D[语义分割]\n    B --&gt; E[车道线检测]\n    B --&gt; F[可行驶区域]\n    C --&gt; G[BEV 融合表示]\n    D --&gt; G\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[预测与规划]</pre><p>自动驾驶感知系统通常融合多种传感器：相机提供丰富的语义和纹理信息，激光雷达提供精确的三维几何信息，毫米波雷达在恶劣天气下仍能工作。多传感器融合在鸟瞰图（BEV）统一表示空间中进行，已经成为当前的主流范式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>感知任务</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>核心指标</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3D 检测</td>\n<td>相机/激光雷达</td>\n<td>3D 边界框</td>\n<td>NDS, mAP</td>\n<td>BEVFormer, CenterPoint</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义分割</td>\n<td>相机</td>\n<td>像素类别图</td>\n<td>mIoU</td>\n<td>BEVSeg, SegFormer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>车道线检测</td>\n<td>相机</td>\n<td>车道线曲线</td>\n<td>F1-Score</td>\n<td>CLRNet, LaneATT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>占据预测</td>\n<td>多传感器</td>\n<td>3D 体素占据</td>\n<td>mIoU</td>\n<td>Occ3D, SurroundOcc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地图构建</td>\n<td>多传感器</td>\n<td>矢量化地图</td>\n<td>mAP</td>\n<td>MapTR, VectorMapNet</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bev-感知架构\">BEV 感知架构</h2><p>BEV（Bird&#39;s Eye View）感知将多个传感器的数据统一到鸟瞰图表示空间中进行处理。BEV 表示具有天然优势：在 BEV 空间中目标没有遮挡问题，尺度一致（近大远小的透视效应消失），且多传感器的数据可以自然对齐。</p>\n<p>从相机图像到 BEV 特征的转换是 BEV 感知的核心挑战。LSS（Lift-Splat-Shoot）通过在深度维度上显式分布图像特征来完成投影：对每个图像像素预测其深度分布，然后将特征&quot;提升&quot;到三维空间再&quot;铺展&quot;到 BEV 网格上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class LSSTransform(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, depth_bins=59):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.depth_net = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, in_channels, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, depth_bins + in_channels, 1),&#10;        )&#10;        self.depth_bins = depth_bins&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, image_features, intrinsics, extrinsics):&#10;        depth_logits = self.depth_net(image_features)&#10;        depth = depth_logits[:, :self.depth_bins].softmax(dim=1)&#10;        context = depth_logits[:, self.depth_bins:]&#10;        volume = depth.unsqueeze(1) * context.unsqueeze(2)&#10;        return volume\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LSSTransform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, depth_bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">59</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth_net </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, in_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(in_channels),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(in_channels, depth_bins </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth_bins </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth_bins</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, image_features, intrinsics, extrinsics):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        depth_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth_net(image_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        depth </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth_logits[:, :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth_bins].softmax(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth_logits[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.depth_bins:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        volume </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> depth.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> volume</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph BEV 感知流水线&#10;        A[多相机图像] --&gt; B[图像骨干网络]&#10;        B --&gt; C[图像特征]&#10;        C --&gt; D[视角转换 LSS/BEVFormer]&#10;        D --&gt; E[BEV 特征图]&#10;        F[激光雷达点云] --&gt; G[体素化+稀疏卷积]&#10;        G --&gt; H[LiDAR BEV 特征]&#10;        E --&gt; I[多模态融合]&#10;        H --&gt; I&#10;        I --&gt; J[检测/分割/地图头]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph BEV 感知流水线\n        A[多相机图像] --&gt; B[图像骨干网络]\n        B --&gt; C[图像特征]\n        C --&gt; D[视角转换 LSS/BEVFormer]\n        D --&gt; E[BEV 特征图]\n        F[激光雷达点云] --&gt; G[体素化+稀疏卷积]\n        G --&gt; H[LiDAR BEV 特征]\n        E --&gt; I[多模态融合]\n        H --&gt; I\n        I --&gt; J[检测/分割/地图头]\n    end</pre><p>BEVFormer 使用可变形注意力（Deformable Attention）从多相机图像中查询 BEV 空间的特征。它在 BEV 网格上放置可学习的 queries，每个 query 通过投影关系在对应的图像区域上进行注意力采样。BEVFormer 还引入了时序自注意力，将当前帧的 BEV 特征与前几帧的 BEV 特征进行融合，增强了对运动目标的感知能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"占据网络与三维场景表示\">占据网络与三维场景表示</h2><p>占据网络（Occupancy Network）是自动驾驶感知的新范式。传统的 3D 检测以边界框表示目标，无法精确描述不规则形状的物体和通用障碍物。占据网络将三维空间划分为细粒度的体素网格，预测每个体素的占据状态和语义类别，提供了更完整的三维场景理解。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class OccupancyHead(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, bev_channels, num_classes, z_bins=16):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.z_expand = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(bev_channels, bev_channels * z_bins, 1),&#10;        )&#10;        self.sem_head = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv3d(bev_channels, 128, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm3d(128),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv3d(128, num_classes, 1),&#10;        )&#10;        self.z_bins = z_bins&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, bev_features):&#10;        b, c, h, w = bev_features.shape&#10;        volume = self.z_expand(bev_features)&#10;        volume = volume.view(b, c, self.z_bins, h, w)&#10;        semantic = self.sem_head(volume)&#10;        return semantic\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OccupancyHead</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, bev_channels, num_classes, z_bins</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.z_expand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(bev_channels, bev_channels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_bins, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sem_head </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv3d(bev_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm3d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv3d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_classes, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.z_bins </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z_bins</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, bev_features):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        b, c, h, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bev_features.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        volume </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.z_expand(bev_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        volume </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> volume.view(b, c, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.z_bins, h, w)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        semantic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.sem_head(volume)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> semantic</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Occ3D 和 SurroundOcc 是占据预测的代表方法。它们将多相机 BEV 特征扩展到三维体素空间，预测每个体素的语义类别（包括空闲空间）。占据网络在 nuScenes 的 Occ3D 基准和 Waymo 的占据预测挑战中展现出了巨大的潜力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>体素尺寸</th>\n<th>Occ3D mIoU</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MonoScene</td>\n<td>单目相机</td>\n<td>0.2m</td>\n<td>6.1</td>\n<td>纯视觉基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TPVFormer</td>\n<td>多相机</td>\n<td>0.2m</td>\n<td>11.3</td>\n<td>三视角表示</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SurroundOcc</td>\n<td>多相机</td>\n<td>0.2m</td>\n<td>20.3</td>\n<td>稠密监督</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Occ3D</td>\n<td>多相机</td>\n<td>0.4m</td>\n<td>23.8</td>\n<td>大规模标注</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"端到端自动驾驶\">端到端自动驾驶</h2><p>端到端自动驾驶将感知、预测和规划统一到一个神经网络中，直接从传感器输入输出驾驶决策（方向盘角度、油门、刹车）。这种方法避免了传统模块化系统中各模块间的信息丢失和误差累积。</p>\n<p>UniAD（Unified Autonomous Driving）是端到端自动驾驶的标志性工作。它在统一的 Transformer 架构中依次执行检测、追踪、在线建图、运动预测和规划五大任务，任务间通过查询传递（query-based）机制共享信息。每个下游任务都能利用上游任务的输出作为输入，形成了信息流的级联增强。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class EndToEndPlanner(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, bev_channels, num_waypoints=6):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.bev_encoder = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Conv2d(bev_channels, 256, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(256, 128, 3, padding=1),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(1),&#10;        )&#10;        self.command_embed = nn.Embedding(3, 64)&#10;        self.planner = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(128 + 64, 256),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(256, num_waypoints * 2),&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, bev_features, command):&#10;        bev_feat = self.bev_encoder(bev_features).flatten(1)&#10;        cmd_feat = self.command_embed(command)&#10;        combined = torch.cat([bev_feat, cmd_feat], dim=1)&#10;        waypoints = self.planner(combined)&#10;        return waypoints.view(-1, 6, 2)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EndToEndPlanner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, bev_channels, num_waypoints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bev_encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(bev_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.AdaptiveAvgPool2d(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.command_embed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Embedding(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.planner </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, num_waypoints </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, bev_features, command):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        bev_feat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bev_encoder(bev_features).flatten(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        cmd_feat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.command_embed(command)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        combined </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([bev_feat, cmd_feat], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        waypoints </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.planner(combined)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> waypoints.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>VAD（Vectorized Scene Representation for Efficient Autonomous Driving）使用矢量化场景表示，将道路元素（车道线、交通标志）表示为有序点集，避免了稠密 BEV 栅格的高计算成本。DriveVLM 引入了大型视觉-语言模型来增强对复杂驾驶场景的理解和推理能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((自动驾驶感知))&#10;    BEV 架构&#10;      LSS 显式投影&#10;      BEVFormer 注意力&#10;      多传感器融合&#10;    占据网络&#10;      体素化场景&#10;      Occ3D&#10;      SurroundOcc&#10;    端到端&#10;      UniAD&#10;      VAD&#10;      DriveVLM\">mindmap\n  root((自动驾驶感知))\n    BEV 架构\n      LSS 显式投影\n      BEVFormer 注意力\n      多传感器融合\n    占据网络\n      体素化场景\n      Occ3D\n      SurroundOcc\n    端到端\n      UniAD\n      VAD\n      DriveVLM</pre><ul>\n<li>BEV 感知是自动驾驶感知的主流范式，统一了多传感器在鸟瞰空间的融合</li>\n<li>LSS 和 BEVFormer 是相机到 BEV 转换的两大技术路线</li>\n<li>占据网络提供了比 3D 检测框更精细的三维场景理解</li>\n<li>端到端自动驾驶通过统一架构避免了模块间的信息丢失</li>\n<li>UniAD 展示了感知-预测-规划联合训练的巨大潜力</li>\n<li>自动驾驶感知系统的可靠性和安全性是工程化的核心挑战</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自动驾驶感知","id":"自动驾驶感知"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"BEV 感知架构","id":"bev-感知架构"},{"level":2,"text":"占据网络与三维场景表示","id":"占据网络与三维场景表示"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端自动驾驶","id":"端到端自动驾驶"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"医学影像分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-vision/cv-applications/medical-imaging"},"next":null}